# Grammar for the Spanish subset (Phase 2), LL(1) WITHOUT agreement
# Same structure as es.gram with one token type per category. It accepts "los niño come".
# It is not used by the parser: it exists to measure how much the grammar grows
# when agreement is added (compare the production counts of es_base.gram and es.gram).
# Accepted LL(1) conflict: M[NpTail, PREP], as in es.gram.

Sentence -> Clause EndMark
Clause -> NounPhrase VerbPhrase
EndMark -> PERIOD | ε
NounPhrase -> DET NOUN AdjList NpTail
AdjList -> ADJ AdjList | ε
NpTail -> PrepPhrase NpTail | ε
PrepPhrase -> PREP NounPhrase
VerbPhrase -> VERB VpTail
VpTail -> Object AdvOpt PpList
Object -> NounPhrase | ε
AdvOpt -> ADV | ε
PpList -> PrepPhrase PpList | ε
